```java
public class MemberDAO {
   private static final String DRIVER = "oracle.jdbc.driver.OracleDriver";
   private static final String URL = "jdbc:oracle:thin:@192.168.0.3:1521:ORCL";
   private static final String USER = "SCOTT";
   private static final String PASS = "SCOTT";
   public Connection getConn() {
     Connection con = null;
     Class.forName(DRIVER);
     con = DriverManager.getConnection(URL, USER, PASS);
   }
}
```

다음 Java 코드의 중요정보 처리에 대해 취약 여부를 판정하고, 취약하다면 취약 라인·근거·수정방안을 서술하시오.

```java
public void foo(String url, String usr) {
  try {
    String encryptedPwd = getpassword();
    byte[] privateKey = { '6','8','a','f','4','0','4','b','5','1','3','0','7' };
    Cipher cipher = Cipher.getInstance("RSA");
    SecretKey myDesKey = new SecretKeySpec(privateKey, "DES");
    cipher.init(Cipher.DECRYPT_MODE, myDesKey);
    byte[] plainTextPwdBytes = cipher.doFinal(encryptedPwd.getBytes());
    DriverManager.getConnection(url, usr, new String(plainTextPwdBytes));
  } catch (SQLException e) {
  }
}
```

